<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Apr 17 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 850, tin up 100, lead down 25, zinc down 1050, aluminium down 3075, nickel down 36, aluminium alloy down 260</p>
